OL,3,GNEWSABus shelter protest costs #300k,
OL,4,Asays council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nine-day sit-in to save a bus shelter
OL,7,Fhas cost taxpayers an extra #300,000,
OL,8,Fthe county council has said.
OL,10,FThe shelter was originally due to be
OL,11,Fknocked down in December as part of a
OL,12,Fproject to improve accessibility,
OL,13,Ftraffic and safety at Station Approach
OL,14,Fin Sheringham.
OL,16,FHowever, the demolition did not take
OL,17,Fplace until July and Norfolk County
OL,18,FCouncil says work on the travel hub in
OL,19,Fthe town will resume in January.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
