OL,3,GNEWSABus shelter protest costs #300k,
OL,4,Asays council
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat county councillor Liz
OL,7,FWithington was one of the protesters
OL,8,Fand said despite the cost increase, it
OL,9,Fwas "good" local people made their
OL,10,F"voice heard".
